  "bodyHash": "3c5714aecbebaae6",
  "content": "\n\n<h1>🌿 Cobblemon 植物學整合</h1>\n<p><em>種植、收穫並自動化您的寶可夢植物！</em></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>⚙️ 關於此模組</h2>\n<p><strong>Cobblemon 植物學整合</strong>將兩者的優點完美結合 &mdash; 融合<strong>Botany Pots</strong>的自動化能力與<strong>Cobblemon</strong>的自然多樣性！</p>\n<p>透過此擴充模組，您現在可以直接在<strong>Botany Pots</strong>中種植<strong>Cobblemon 的漿果、種子與特殊植物</strong>，讓您的寶可夢農耕更輕鬆、整潔且完全支援自動化。</p>\n<p>打造屬於自己的<strong>寶可夢溫室</strong>，收穫您最喜愛的漿果，在保持高效運作的同時，讓您的基地美觀動人！</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>🌱 功能特色</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>🌿 <strong>完整支援 Botany Pots</strong> &mdash; 所有可種植的 Cobblemon 物品皆相容</li>\n<li>🍓 <strong>自動種植寶可夢漿果</strong>於花盆中</li>\n<li>💧 <strong>支援雙模組的土壤與生長條件</strong></li>\n<li>🧰 <strong>安裝簡易</strong> &mdash; 下載安裝即可開始種植！</li>\n<li>⚡ <strong>極適合自動化</strong>佈局，可搭配漏斗、管線或模組化物品系統使用</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>🧩 相容性</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>✅ <strong>Cobblemon</strong>（必要）</li>\n<li>✅ <strong>Botany Pots</strong>（必要）</li>\n<li>⚙️ 適用 <strong>Minecraft 1.21.1 以上版本</strong></li>\n<li>🔧 支援 <strong>NeoForge</strong> 與 <strong>Fabric</strong> 載入器</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>📦 安裝方式</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>確保已安裝<strong>Cobblemon</strong>與<strong>Botany Pots</strong>。</li>\n<li>下載<strong>Cobblemon Botany Integration</strong>。</li>\n<li>將<code>.jar</code>檔案放入<code>mods</code>資料夾中。</li>\n<li>啟動 Minecraft 並開始種植吧！🌾</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h2>💡 應用範例</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>建置自動化漿果農場以生產寶可夢球。</li>\n<li>利用生長的漿果打造裝飾性寶可夢花園。</li>\n<li>與其他自動化模組搭配，組建全自動收割系統！</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">我的其他模組：</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-cobblemon-industries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1275153/description_bc53f78d-303b-42ba-8cf1-432880111c6b.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon-simple-pokecenters\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1275153/description_a06ced40-ba05-41b8-b825-2c04d21b1daa.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon-egg-spawner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1275153/description_874907dd-1c16-4623-a8e1-b250fa69d933.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon-simple-smart-healer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1275153/description_ef5fb44c-113e-4fe6-a208-3542c670447c.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon-poke-labs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1275153/description_a1a0d1aa-1c16-461c-896b-f6c3a456c046.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon-mekanism-industries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1275153/description_26c495f1-de71-4b09-996c-215e2b525d05.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1275153/description_4852adae-28a3-4ef0-80a8-0d59fe2eec14.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>📜 授權條款</h2>\n<p>本專案採用<strong>MIT 授權條款</strong>。<br>只要註明出處，您可以自由使用、修改並將其納入模組包中。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><em>✨ 一步步培育您的寶可夢世界 &mdash; 從一顆漿果開始！🍇</em></p>",
